    "comment": "No les funcionaba la app de YPF y abonando con Mercado Pago se negaron a hacer factura A. Hable con el encargado y se negaron a darme solución alguna. Calidad de servicio al cliente desperdiciada por \"burocracia\" interna.\n\n(Translated by Google)\nThe YPF app wasn\u0027t working, and even though I paid with Mercado Pago, they refused to issue an invoice. I spoke with the manager, and they refused to offer any solution. Customer service quality wasted due to internal bureaucracy.",
